{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>And I will destroy your high places, and I will cut down your sun-images.</b> This is not included among the curses, for it is the abolition of idolatry." "<b>Your sun-images.</b> It is from the root חמה (sun); the nun is added to it, like the nun of נשים רחמניות (merciful women)." "<b>And I will place your carcasses upon the carcasses of your idols.</b> Corresponding to 'And I will be to you for Elohim, and you shall be to Me for a people' — and this is the second." "<b>And My soul will abhor you.</b> Corresponding to 'And My soul will not abhor you' — and this is the third."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:15:37.078120388Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}